OL,3,GNEWSA'Shocking' mounds of rubbish
OL,4,Adumped at derelict school
OL,5,
OL,6,FA "shocking" amount of waste dumped
OL,7,Foutside a derelict school building is
OL,8,Fspilling on to residents' properties,
OL,9,Fcouncillors have said.
OL,11,FCouncillor Usman Bhaimia, from
OL,12,FGloucester City Council, condemned the
OL,13,F"shocking" amount of fly-tipped rubbish
OL,14,Fat Colwell Grammar School and said he
OL,15,Fis investigating who is responsible for
OL,16,Fthe mess.
OL,18,FMattresses, furniture, dirty nappies
OL,19,Fand a caravan are among the waste
OL,20,Fthrown on Derby Road.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
